        {
          "text": " Mimi niwaiwanulia nabii miongoni mwa ndugu zao mfano wako wewe, nami nitatia maneno yangu kinywani mwake, naye atawaambia yote nitakayomwamuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.18",
